OL,3,ASaudi capital airport hit by second
OL,4,AHouthi strike in two days
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn international airport in the Saudi
OL,7,Fcapital Riyadh has been hit by a second
OL,8,Fstrike in as many days, officials have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FA Saudi military spokesman said a
OL,12,Fprojectile had hit King Khalid
OL,13,FInternational Airport on Sunday,
OL,14,Fcausing a fire in one of its passenger
OL,15,Fhalls. Saudi Arabia's civil aviation
OL,16,Fauthority said there had been injuries.
OL,18,FIt comes a day after a strike on the
OL,19,Fsame airport killed 13 people and
OL,20,Finjured 308 others, following similar
OL,21,Fstrikes earlier this week.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
