OL,3,AUkraine strikes Yandex data centre in
OL,4,Athird attack on Russian tech giant
OL,5,
OL,6,FYandex has been forced to pause its
OL,7,Foperations at a data centre near Moscow
OL,8,Fafter the facility was damaged in a
OL,9,FUkrainian drone strike - the third
OL,10,Fattack on the Russian tech giant's
OL,11,Fsites this week.
OL,13,FThe company - dubbed "Russia's Google"
OL,14,F- said no one was injured at the centre
OL,15,Fin Vladimir, east of the capital, but
OL,16,Fsome of its services were unavailable
OL,17,Fto users.
OL,19,FEarlier this week, Yandex said it was
OL,20,Fstruggling to maintain its services
OL,21,Fafter two of its five data centres were
OL,22,Fhit in Ukrainian strikes.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
